From 3e54b098f14594603f177dd3a5a7c92eb9e8d7b9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ash Pera <ashley.pera@noaa.gov>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 17:10:16 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 15/19] Noah-MP: condense the water for negative transpiration
 heat on the canopy

vege_flux can return a negative transpiration heat flux (fctr < 0: vapour
condensing through the stomatal pathway). canwater takes
etran = max(fctr/hvap, 0), so that latent heat warms the canopy but no
water condenses: Noah-MP's water and its latent heat flux disagree.

Count that condensation as dew (or frost, on a frozen canopy) on the
canopy, through the existing qdewc/qfroc pathway. The energy solution is
unchanged; only the water follows it.

Measured with in-model meters (C96 control_p8_ugwpv1, 24 h, 1.77M soil
column-steps, all other water-conservation fixes applied): fctr < 0 on
13 % of column-steps, and Noah-MP's latent energy exceeded the latent
energy of its water by 0.024 W/m2 per land column; with the fix the total
mismatch is 0.0013 W/m2 (the canopy evaporation cap, unchanged). The fix
adds about 8e-4 mm/day of canopy dew over land. Water closure is
unchanged.
---
 physics/SFC_Models/Land/Noahmp/module_sf_noahmplsm.F90 | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/physics/SFC_Models/Land/Noahmp/module_sf_noahmplsm.F90 b/physics/SFC_Models/Land/Noahmp/module_sf_noahmplsm.F90
index 9e25d2b7..77ea571d 100644
--- a/physics/SFC_Models/Land/Noahmp/module_sf_noahmplsm.F90
+++ b/physics/SFC_Models/Land/Noahmp/module_sf_noahmplsm.F90
@@ -7338,7 +7338,8 @@ zolmax = xkrefsqr / sqrt(xkzo)   ! maximum z/L
       if (.not.frozen_canopy) then             ! barlage: change to frozen_canopy
         etran = max( fctr/hvap, 0. )
         qevac = max( fcev/hvap, 0. )
-        qdewc = abs( min( fcev/hvap, 0. ) )
+        ! condensation in the transpiration pathway (fctr < 0) is dew on the canopy
+        qdewc = abs( min( fcev/hvap, 0. ) ) + abs( min( fctr/hvap, 0. ) )
         qsubc = 0.
         qfroc = 0.
       else
@@ -7346,7 +7347,7 @@ zolmax = xkrefsqr / sqrt(xkzo)   ! maximum z/L
         qevac = 0.
         qdewc = 0.
         qsubc = max( fcev/hsub, 0. )
-        qfroc = abs( min( fcev/hsub, 0. ) )
+        qfroc = abs( min( fcev/hsub, 0. ) ) + abs( min( fctr/hsub, 0. ) )
       endif
 
 ! canopy water balance. for convenience allow dew to bring canliq above
